# ==========================================
# 8-BIT BOOTH MULTIPLIER - TIMING CONSTRAINTS
# Target: Basys 3 (Artix-7)
# FPGA: xc7a35tcpg236-1
# Clock: 50 MHz (20 ns)
# ==========================================

# Clock constraint
create_clock -name clk -period 20.000 [get_ports clk]

# Input delay constraints
set_input_delay -clock clk -max 2.000 [get_ports {A[*] B[*]}]
set_input_delay -clock clk -min 0.000 [get_ports {A[*] B[*]}]

# Output delay constraints
set_output_delay -clock clk -max 2.000 [get_ports {P[*]}]
set_output_delay -clock clk -min 0.000 [get_ports {P[*]}]

# Clock uncertainty
set_clock_uncertainty 0.500 [get_clocks clk]
